  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_header.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fD1D8LKA5N\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://ko-fi.com/img/githubbutton_sm.svg\" alt=\"Ko-fi\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fS5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/869218732650688543?color=14822e&label=DISCORD&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/finndog_123/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/CurseForge-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&logo=curseforge\" alt=\"CurseForge 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fFinnDog_123\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-projects-14822e?style=for-the-badge&logo=modrinth\" alt=\"Modrinth 專案\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/c110cc09347a4f9f9de6c974f2fa35d8.png\" alt=\"瀏覽建築\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_overview.webp\" alt=\"總覽\"></p>\n<p>此模組適用於 Forge、Fabric、NeoForge 與 Quilt！也可僅安裝於伺服器端。Forge 支援在 1.20.4 版本後已移除。</p>\n<h3>關於</h3>\n<p>Moogs Soaring Structures 為您的《我的世界》世界注入活力、樂趣與多樣性，加入了大量帶有酷炫建築及其他可探索內容的浮空島嶼！探索由原版方塊與實體打造的精彩新建築，並在途中發現戰利品、敵對生物與村民。本模組相容於任何整合包，甚至僅安裝於伺服器端即可運作！</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://pub-24a4e0e7ea8544a5b6f73c3a23512589.r2.dev/images/f8fe835413394a76b10a678afefea30f.png\" alt=\"以 3D 即時瀏覽所有建築\"></a></p>\n<p>若要查看部分建築，請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpreviews.moogsmods.com%252fsoaring-structures%252f1.21.1%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">預覽網站</a></p>\n<h3>設定包</h3>\n<p>模組的每個層面均可使用資料包進行自訂。包含完整說明文件的範本可於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/data-packs/mss-moogs-soaring-structure-config-pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a> 取得。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_features.webp\" alt=\"功能特色\"> <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1040210/description_84b68622-1f45-4dd0-b110-ff18e67252ac.png\" alt=\"拼貼圖\"></p>\n<h3>影片</h3>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uiA_VsbAYgo?si=ytBXGNcAblSRa62-&start=409\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/uWsSgXHbGwo?si=LIWDsyhLydDAFH5b&start=567\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/DL5nGIa6K2Y?si=1_N6a2DM50MrtfJW\" width=\"320\" height=\"180\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div>\n<h3>整合包</h3>\n<p>查看所有整合包請點 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.modpackindex.com%252fmodpack%252ffinder%253fincluded_mods%253d61020\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">此處</a>。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_discord.webp\" alt=\"橫幅\"></p>\n<p>獲得回覆最佳且最快速的方式是加入我們的 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/S5nffJbuvA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fmoogsmods%253fr%253dcfmss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Moogs_Soaring_Structure/BH_MSS_promo.webp\" alt=\"BH 贊助\"></a></p>",
